</node>
</node>
</node>
<node name="Tools &amp; Services" unique_id="282" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="1" foreground="#e647ba" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text>One node per tool and one per service. </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 283" foreground="#e647ba">BloodHound</rich_text>
<rich_text> and </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 284" foreground="#e647ba">LDAP</rich_text>
<rich_text> are there to start you off.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>For a new one, duplicate </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Templates › Tool</rich_text>
<rich_text> or </rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Templates › Service</rich_text>
<rich_text> (</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Tree › Duplicate Node</rich_text>
<rich_text>) and drag the copy here.</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<node name="BloodHound" unique_id="283" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cape tool" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">At a glance
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Job: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Maps Active Directory and shows paths to high-value groups</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Learned in: </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 74" foreground="#e647ba">M04 - Active Directory BloodHound</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Install: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Collector on a domain host, GUI on your attack box</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Go-To Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">the ones you reach for first, best one on top</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Options Worth Knowing</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Use Cases</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">one heading per job you use it for</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h3" weight="heavy" style="italic">e.g. Find a path from your user to Domain Admins</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Reading the Output</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">what a good result looks like, and what you do next</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. Mark owned users first, then the shortest-path queries start from them</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">When It Fails</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Gotchas / Lessons Learned</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Links</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>Used in: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">link the methodology phase(s)</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>Services: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" link="node 284" foreground="#e647ba">LDAP</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>Index: </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 13" foreground="#e647ba">Modules</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<codebox char_offset="254" justification="left" frame_width="100" frame_height="74" width_in_pixels="0" syntax_highlighting="sh" highlight_brackets="1" show_line_numbers="0"># command            # what it does</codebox>
<table char_offset="279" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="119,240,240"><row><cell>e.g. -c All</cell><cell>e.g. Collects every data type</cell><cell>e.g. First run on a new domain</cell></row><row><cell>Option</cell><cell>What it does</cell><cell>When I use it</cell></row></table>
<codebox char_offset="396" justification="left" frame_width="100" frame_height="74" width_in_pixels="0" syntax_highlighting="sh" highlight_brackets="1" show_line_numbers="0"># command            # what it does</codebox>
<table char_offset="563" justification="left" col_min="60" col_max="240" is_light="0" col_widths="240,240,240"><row><cell>e.g. Graph is missing a whole OU</cell><cell>e.g. Collector ran without rights to read it</cell><cell>e.g. Collect again as a user who can</cell></row><row><cell>Symptom</cell><cell>Likely cause</cell><cell>Fix or backup tool</cell></row></table>
</node>
<node name="LDAP" unique_id="284" master_id="0" prog_lang="custom-colors" tags="cape service" readonly="0" nosearch_me="0" nosearch_ch="0" custom_icon_id="0" is_bold="0" foreground="" ts_creation="1792540800" ts_lastsave="1792540800">
<rich_text weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">At a glance
</rich_text>
<rich_text>What it is: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. The directory that holds every user, group and computer in the domain</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Default ports: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. 389, 636</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Learned in: </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 51" foreground="#e647ba">M02 - Active Directory LDAP</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>Usual tools: </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">e.g. </rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" link="node 283" foreground="#e647ba">BloodHound</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic">, ldapsearch</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">First Look</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">the first commands you run against a new instance</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Checklist</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Version noted and searched for known issues</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Anonymous or guest access tried</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Default credentials tried</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Creds from </rich_text>
<rich_text link="node 289" foreground="#e647ba">Credentials</rich_text>
<rich_text> tried here</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>☐ </rich_text>
<rich_text>Everything readable or writable listed</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Red Flags</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">things that usually mean a way forward</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Commands by Goal</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">one heading per thing you want from it</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h3" weight="heavy" style="italic">e.g. List users and groups</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Notes</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text weight="heavy">Commands</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Gotchas / Lessons Learned</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>• </rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text scale="h2" weight="heavy" foreground="#e647ba">Links</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
